  "content": {
    "equation": "Dose in mL = Dose / (Drug Amount / Per)\n• Dose in mL is calculated in mL\n• Dose is input in g, mcg, mEq, mg, mmol, or units\no Input unit must match input unit of Drug Amount\n• Drug Amount is input in g, mcg, mEq, mg, mmol, or units\no Input unit must match input unit of Dose\n• Per is input in mL",
    "notes": [],
    "conditional_notes": [
      "\nWarning: Calculator does not make adjustments for maximum doses - please check all\ncalculations with dosing in monograph<\\/p>\nNote: Doses may need to be rounded to accommodate available dosage forms<\\/p>"
